  m_text: "Back before all four megacorps rose to prominence, a disabled bird glanced
    up at the sky and yearned to explore it. He would see his friends, his family,
    and even his beloved wife live his dream... but he remained firmly planted to
    the ground. \n\nIt was isolating..."
