  ChallengeName: MapChallenge
  MascotEntranceText: 'With a new rank comes a new secret.<n>

    And today I give
    you our founding myth!<n>

    However, due to a drop in attention spans, it
    does come with a reading comprehension test!<n>

    Please place the tiles in
    the order they occur in the story!'
  MascotExitText: 'Great work! Your upload is complete!<n>

    After processing
    your data, we think you''d do best working with the business portion of Flock!<n>

    Please
    report to your local nest immediately so that you can meet your new family!<n>

    Also,
    please make sure to rate <b>Visions</b> five stars on the game store!'
